<title>GERMANY: SKW Trostberg to seek outside financing.</title>
<headline>SKW Trostberg to seek outside financing.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>SKW Trostberg AG said on Monday that it was planning to seek outside financing and was not considering a capital rise to finance the purchase of Master Builders Technologies (MBT).</p>
<p>The German specialty chemicals group earlier this morning announced that it had signed an agreement with Swiss chemicals group Sandoz AG to buy MBT.</p>
<p>The sale is expected to be completed during the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>SKW is a unit of utility group Viag AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
